ont-ligatures-none mx-0.5 rounded-[4px] border border-stroke-300 bg-spot-pe=
ach-200/50 px-1 py-px font-mono text-foreground-800 text-sm dark:bg-midnigh=
t-900" style=3D"opacity: 1;">F10</code>).</span></p></li></ul></li><li clas=
s=3D"ps-2" style=3D"opacity: 1;"><p><span class=3D"font-ligatures-none"><st=
rong>Enable Virtualization in Stages</strong></span></p><ul class=3D"relati=
