## * Step 1: *Golden Moment* Intervention Package (Ready-to-Inject)

You can inject this package into the live OOBE-prepped image, then reimage =
with DiskGenius. Here=E2=80=99s the exact layout and file content:

### * Target Structure
```
C:\Windows\Setup\Scripts\
=E2=94=9C=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 SetupComplete.cmd
=E2=94=94=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 DriverStage.ps1
```

### * SetupComplete.cmd

```cmd
@echo off
:: Block automatic driver updates
reg add "HKLM\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\DriverSearching" /v=
 SearchOrderConfig /t REG_DWORD /d 0 /f

:: Set Windows Update to manual mode (notify before download/install)
reg add "HKLM\SOFTWARE\Policies\Microsoft\Windows\WindowsUpdate\AU" /v AUOp=
tions /t REG_DWORD /d 2 /f

:: Optional: trigger driver staging
powershell.exe -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File "%SystemRoot%\Setup\Scripts\Dr=
iverStage.ps1"
exit 0
```

### * DriverStage.ps1

```powershell
$driverPath =3D "C:\Drivers"

Get-ChildItem -Path $driverPath -Recurse -Include *.inf | ForEach-Object {
    pnputil /add-driver $_.FullName /install
}

# Optional log
$log =3D "$env:SystemDrive\DriverInstallLog.txt"
"Drivers installed at $(Get-Date)" | Out-File $log
```

